       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TTXNEXEC.
      *================================================================*
      * UNIT TESTS FOR TXNEXEC - TRANSFER LEGS, SAME ACCOUNT, MISSING  *
      * TARGET AND THE REVERSAL WHEN THE CREDIT LEG FAILS              *
      *================================================================*
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ACCT-FILE ASSIGN TO 'data/ACCTMAST.DAT'
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS ACCT-NO FILE STATUS IS UT-ACCT-FS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  ACCT-FILE.
           COPY ACCTREC.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY TXNPARM.
           COPY POSTPARM.
           COPY UTWS.
           COPY UTSEEDW.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'TXNEXEC' TO UT-SUITE
           MOVE 'S' TO UT-SEED-TYPE
           MOVE 'A' TO UT-SEED-STATUS
           MOVE 1000 TO UT-SEED-MIN
           MOVE ZERO TO UT-SEED-OD
           MOVE 'DEL001' TO UT-SEED-BRANCH
           MOVE 20000 TO UT-SEED-BALANCE
           MOVE 1000000001 TO UT-SEED-NO
           PERFORM UT-SEED-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 5000 TO UT-SEED-BALANCE
           MOVE 1000000002 TO UT-SEED-NO
           PERFORM UT-SEED-ACCOUNT

           MOVE 'TRANSFER 7,000: RC 00' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-TRANSFER-SETUP
           MOVE 1000000002 TO TX-TO-ACCT
           MOVE 7000 TO TX-AMOUNT
           CALL 'TXNEXEC' USING TXN-PARMS POST-PARMS
           MOVE ZERO TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE TX-RC TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM
           MOVE 'SOURCE DEBITED' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 1000000001 TO UT-SEED-NO
           PERFORM UT-READ-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 13000 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE ACCT-BALANCE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM
           MOVE 'TARGET CREDITED' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 1000000002 TO UT-SEED-NO
           PERFORM UT-READ-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 12000 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE ACCT-BALANCE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'SAME ACCOUNT -> RC 30' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-TRANSFER-SETUP
           MOVE 1000000001 TO TX-TO-ACCT
           MOVE 10 TO TX-AMOUNT
           CALL 'TXNEXEC' USING TXN-PARMS POST-PARMS
           MOVE 30 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE TX-RC TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'MISSING TARGET -> RC 20, NOTHING DEBITED' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-TRANSFER-SETUP
           MOVE 1999999999 TO TX-TO-ACCT
           MOVE 10 TO TX-AMOUNT
           CALL 'TXNEXEC' USING TXN-PARMS POST-PARMS
           MOVE 20 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE TX-RC TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'INSUFFICIENT FUNDS -> RC 10' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-TRANSFER-SETUP
           MOVE 1000000002 TO TX-TO-ACCT
           MOVE 13000 TO TX-AMOUNT
           CALL 'TXNEXEC' USING TXN-PARMS POST-PARMS
           MOVE 10 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE TX-RC TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

      *    TARGET FROZEN AFTER THE CHECK WOULD FAIL THE CREDIT LEG;
      *    A FROZEN TARGET IS CAUGHT BY THE INQUIRY FIRST
           MOVE 'F' TO UT-SEED-STATUS
           MOVE 1000000003 TO UT-SEED-NO
           PERFORM UT-SEED-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 'FROZEN TARGET: SOURCE UNCHANGED' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-TRANSFER-SETUP
           MOVE 1000000003 TO TX-TO-ACCT
           MOVE 100 TO TX-AMOUNT
           CALL 'TXNEXEC' USING TXN-PARMS POST-PARMS
           MOVE 1000000001 TO UT-SEED-NO
           PERFORM UT-READ-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 13000 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE ACCT-BALANCE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           PERFORM UT-FINISH
           STOP RUN.

       8000-TRANSFER-SETUP.
           INITIALIZE TXN-PARMS POST-PARMS
           SET TX-TRANSFER TO TRUE
           MOVE 1000000001 TO TX-FROM-ACCT
           MOVE 'UNIT TEST' TO TX-NARRATION.

           COPY UTSEEDP.
           COPY UTPROC.
